WEBVTT

00:00:00.548 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:04.430
Three small things in Settings save your salon a lot of trouble:

00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:09.150
a cancellation deadline, bank transfer details, and invoice details.

00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:10.510
Let's do them one by one.

00:00:11.124 --> 00:00:14.429
Open Settings, and scroll down to Salon preferences.

00:00:14.778 --> 00:00:17.642
Under Customers can cancel up to, choose a deadline,

00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:20.509
for example twenty-four hours before the appointment.

00:00:20.858 --> 00:00:24.989
After that deadline, customers can no longer cancel online themselves.

00:00:25.178 --> 00:00:26.349
Only the salon can.

00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:29.385
Right below is the Cancellation policy box.

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:32.585
Write your salon's rules in a few lines, for example:

00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:35.625
late cancellations and no-shows are charged.

00:00:35.974 --> 00:00:39.625
Customers see this right after booking, and in their confirmation email.

00:00:39.858 --> 00:00:41.625
When you've written it, tap Save.

00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:44.433
Scroll down to Payments and invoices.

00:00:44.698 --> 00:00:49.173
Under Receive bank transfer payments, fill in the bank name, the account number,

00:00:49.123 --> 00:00:50.833
and the account holder's name.

00:00:51.182 --> 00:00:53.233
Then tap Save bank details.

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.735
Customers will see these details when they book,

00:00:55.685 --> 00:00:58.193
so they can transfer the money straight to your salon.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.600
Last, Invoice details:

00:01:00.709 --> 00:01:05.400
company name, address, tax number, and the VAT percentage.

00:01:05.669 --> 00:01:08.760
You need to fill these in before you can issue invoices at the counter.

00:01:09.061 --> 00:01:11.640
Tap Save invoice details, and you're done.

00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:13.160
Now take the quiz below.
